<title>UK: BMW-Rolls-Royce venture names chairman.</title>
<headline>BMW-Rolls-Royce venture names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Rolls-Royce Plc and Germany's Bayerische Motoren-Werke AG (BMW) said on Wednesday they named Klaus Nittinger chairman of their joint venture aero engine company, effective on July 31.</p>
<p>Nittinger will succeed Albert Schneider, who will retire from the joint venture, BMW Rolls-Royce GmbH, the companies said in a joint statement released here. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
